            "notes": "### **\u2728 I'll be watching over you \u2728**\n\n___________________\n\n### \ud83d\udcab POWERS\n\n\u2b50 [Threads of Fate](item_cb61612b-9d83-49a9-989d-013bf084fbcb)\n- Great for cash and high support; Make sure to switch between two teammates often enough to heal or boost two people at the same time.\n\n___________________\n\n### \u2694\ufe0f ITEMS\n\n- [First Aid Kit](item_0172eaaa-1902-44a3-b989-d12f0f7301da) for a little survival perk\n- [Compensator](item_2a354f80-610c-4661-9bdd-8960ae1a60b0) for extra healing\n- [Weapon Grease](item_961ae72f-434f-406b-a89b-ab8efec806bf) for extra healing\n\nI personally prefer [First Aid Kit](item_0172eaaa-1902-44a3-b989-d12f0f7301da) over [Armored Vest](item_358361e2-59be-4c81-b221-8a87f37809e6). I think the health regen perk is better than such a small amount of armor.",
